            "value": "The API Key is stored in the macOS Keychain and never displayed back. The Agent can read the terminal context and files under the current directory (read-only). It cannot run commands."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 保存在 macOS 钥匙串中，保存后不再回显。Agent 可读取终端上下文与当前目录中的文件（只读），但不会执行任何命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
